        "name": {
          "en-US": "BT Off on Wi-Fi"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Turns Bluetooth off on your home Wi-Fi and back on when you leave"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Switches Bluetooth off while the phone is on one of your chosen Wi-Fi networks,\nand (optionally) back on once you have left.\n\n* Several Wi-Fi names; adjustable delay after arriving (default 5 min) and after leaving (default 1 min)\n* Stays on while earbuds or a headset are connected; watches and other low-energy devices do not count\n* \"Keep Bluetooth on\" timer from the app, a quick settings tile or the notification\n* No internet permission\n\nAndroid 13+ only lets apps that target Android 12 switch Bluetooth, so this app targets API 31 on purpose.\nLocation (\"Allow all the time\") is needed because Android only reveals the Wi-Fi name to apps with it."
        },
        "preferredSigner": "4d2aabcc4dfb19fad8ca5a6fd2a7ee55c77990e145ffae2acba00b60643be220"
